    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/8f6adfe8351b73592eb18f46824506d6.avif?t=1747927181\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomads Descent: Last Stand is a roguelike exploration and survival game where you delve into procedurally generated dungeons filled with enemies, traps, and secrets. Choose from a variety of classes with unique abilities and customize your character with each new journey. Find rare treasures, upgrade your arsenal, and face challenges that demand tactical adaptation. Every new run offers a unique and challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple playable classes, each with unique abilities. With every new run, you can choose a class and customize your skills, creating different strategies for each journey. The variety of options ensures a constantly fresh and engaging gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/1d20d1e3d928744173dc26b1b272321f.poster.avif?t=1747927181\" width=784 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/1d20d1e3d928744173dc26b1b272321f.webm?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/1d20d1e3d928744173dc26b1b272321f.mp4?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is full of challenges and rewards. Dungeons packed with diverse enemies and traps require constant adaptation, while secret passages and hidden treasures offer valuable surprises. Discover rare artifacts and unlock new powers as you navigate dangerous environments, where every secret you find can change the course of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/326ae24d7957d72e4cd2895619e286f9.poster.avif?t=1747927181\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/326ae24d7957d72e4cd2895619e286f9.webm?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/326ae24d7957d72e4cd2895619e286f9.mp4?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges Await You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dungeons, you will face a wide variety of enemies and traps, testing your combat and strategic skills. Each environment offers new obstacles that require tactical adaptation, creating a unique and challenge-filled experience with every exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/50f085b2cc17f3c4baf002b2ea4fd28c.poster.avif?t=1747927181\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/50f085b2cc17f3c4baf002b2ea4fd28c.webm?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/50f085b2cc17f3c4baf002b2ea4fd28c.mp4?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/8f6adfe8351b73592eb18f46824506d6.avif?t=1747927181\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomads Descent: Last Stand is a roguelike exploration and survival game where you delve into procedurally generated dungeons filled with enemies, traps, and secrets. Choose from a variety of classes with unique abilities and customize your character with each new journey. Find rare treasures, upgrade your arsenal, and face challenges that demand tactical adaptation. Every new run offers a unique and challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple playable classes, each with unique abilities. With every new run, you can choose a class and customize your skills, creating different strategies for each journey. The variety of options ensures a constantly fresh and engaging gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/1d20d1e3d928744173dc26b1b272321f.poster.avif?t=1747927181\" width=784 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/1d20d1e3d928744173dc26b1b272321f.webm?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/1d20d1e3d928744173dc26b1b272321f.mp4?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is full of challenges and rewards. Dungeons packed with diverse enemies and traps require constant adaptation, while secret passages and hidden treasures offer valuable surprises. Discover rare artifacts and unlock new powers as you navigate dangerous environments, where every secret you find can change the course of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/326ae24d7957d72e4cd2895619e286f9.poster.avif?t=1747927181\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/326ae24d7957d72e4cd2895619e286f9.webm?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/326ae24d7957d72e4cd2895619e286f9.mp4?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges Await You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dungeons, you will face a wide variety of enemies and traps, testing your combat and strategic skills. Each environment offers new obstacles that require tactical adaptation, creating a unique and challenge-filled experience with every exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/50f085b2cc17f3c4baf002b2ea4fd28c.poster.avif?t=1747927181\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/50f085b2cc17f3c4baf002b2ea4fd28c.webm?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594560/extras/50f085b2cc17f3c4baf002b2ea4fd28c.mp4?t=1747927181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
